rs in Japan.\n", "short_description": "The Australian Open VR app is your ticket to the best immersive and interactive experience from the Rod Laver Arena. Content available only for users in Japan.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "748208292787655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568674_748208299454321_9199275796024111845_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CAbQcTUdBBgQ7kNvwF4L9Q2&_nc_oc=Adp6I8CEEwwpZc2BHjvK3IxYTB74lwnIZ90ENC_Zc_kFvhA8lvT8CafeLkqg4O_gW9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bzTbFtkj7ZGAIWyh1RANfEdq_UBMXXxche1JwSSIEUw&oe=6A317679"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "704643830420157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230051_704643833753490_981048534016631306_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=90OoOs1U0akQ7kNvwHpIWgc&_nc_oc=AdrKKKWoUvrbnpPKQAUKkxs0iWNEFhfEQzId0VLUJ6B_l-0hXy18y2NgY4ATtbLS7-Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_EwrdLprNCfJyyrO2MtJ7CujvwRDZB03ES1QYdwpI2EQ&oe=6A316909"}, {"file_name": "Square.png", "id": "483520132656129", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75666286_483520139322795_3526818540801169626_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zJiKNivtZAgQ7kNvwHz-xPf&_nc_oc=AdrM9hrG2IR2g-ohmTTLtNHlMLjHsbLbHMaAIgSnltfMy1USN21FZU-OjTNg44yVX6k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-5M0b_wLJabK_U4RF2xXlXZ2aICdIcCltVQdO3l3ZDsA&oe=6A316CEE"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "426648561976328", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_426648565309661_6996016450691187172_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_w6tW-V8f9YQ7kNvwEs92u5&_nc_oc=AdpXMQZVn_yD_yGzsijLILwzTq8CmSnoU5vlBXh6ITpVimZeUQ87LZp40MbmRtuc1Qk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-a